   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS App Runner API (2020-05-15). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Auto scaling configurations, observability configurations, connections and VPC connectors are configuration metadata. Each name holds exactly one revision (1); creating another revision of a live name is refused, so LatestOnly and DeleteAllRevisions have no further effect. The AWS-provided DefaultConfiguration is not listed. Connections stay PENDING_HANDSHAKE: no GitHub or Bitbucket handshake is performed. VPC connectors store subnet and security group identifiers without checking them or creating network interfaces. Services, custom domains, deployments, VPC ingress connections and operations are not implemented: CreateService, StartDeployment, PauseService and other workload APIs return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501.",
   "name": "AWS App Runner"
  }
